WEBVTT

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:01.474
Is this gold burger genius or a

00:00:01.494 --> 00:00:02.585
total scam?

00:00:03.115 --> 00:00:04.763
Course four is a surprise.

00:00:04.996 --> 00:00:06.659
The chef takes that wagyu and builds

00:00:06.679 --> 00:00:09.179
a burger, a thick patty seared until

00:00:09.199 --> 00:00:11.744
the fat glistens, on a toasted brioche

00:00:11.764 --> 00:00:12.553
bun.

00:00:13.083 --> 00:00:15.427
Next comes a spoonful of caviar,

00:00:15.602 --> 00:00:17.703
the salted eggs of the sturgeon fish.

00:00:17.936 --> 00:00:20.296
The rarest comes from an albino sturgeon,

00:00:20.316 --> 00:00:22.003
and can cost tens of thousands of

00:00:22.023 --> 00:00:23.310
dollars a kilo.

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:25.627
The finishing touch is real,

00:00:25.802 --> 00:00:28.286
edible, twenty four karat gold leaf.

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:29.486
Did you already know?

00:00:29.506 --> 00:00:30.484
It is so thin,

00:00:30.504 --> 00:00:32.210
it is completely edible.

00:00:32.740 --> 00:00:34.364
Team burger or team scam?

00:00:34.656 --> 00:00:36.141
Comment your pick below.
